  "key_observations_html": "<div style=\"border:1px solid #C7D8E8;border-radius:10px;padding:0.75rem 0.95rem;margin:0.1rem 0 0.55rem;background:#ffffff;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);\"><ul style=\"margin:0.1rem 0 0 1.05rem;padding:0;color:#1F4C67;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.45;\"><li><strong>Stablecoin market cap fell 3.5% over 30D:</strong> Stablecoin market cap at $284.86B (3.5% lower over 30D). Related: <a href=\"https://www.coindesk.com/business/2026/11/03/stablecoin-governance-group-behind-ousd-sets-out-management-fee-offers-equity-earning-pool\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Stablecoin governance group behind OUSD sets out management fee, offers equity earning pool</a> (CoinDesk).</li><li><strong>Stablecoin market structure remains concentration-led:</strong> leadership is still defined by a small set of large issuers/platforms; share shifts matter as much as aggregate market-cap growth. Related: <a href=\"https://thedefiant.io/converge/tradfi-and-fintech/visa-stablecoin-payments-explained-settlement-spending-and-payouts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Visa Stablecoin Payments Explained: Settlement, Spending and Payouts</a> (The Defiant).</li><li><strong>Policy and reserves are resetting issuer priorities:</strong> Issuer and platform share can shift before aggregate market cap does, because policy and reserve quality determine which names institutions will hold. Related: <a href=\"https://www.theblock.co/news/business/2026-11-02-binance-zero-knowledge-proof-of-reserves-snapshot-hack-recovery-432321\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Binance completes latest proof of reserves as it works to restore assets, withdrawals after record hack</a> (The Block).</li></ul><p class=\"takeaways__note\">Context only\u2014not investment advice. Bullets combine on-page data with recent industry headlines.</p></div><p class=\"review-note ko-disclaimer\">Key observations are AI generated and should be reviewed for accuracy.</p>",
